item.minegenshin.beyond_the_chrysalis.pa:
After the equipper casts an Elemental Skill or Burst, they gain one of the following effects in order:
- Wind of Loyalty: CRIT DMG +56% for 10s;
- Wind of Renunciation: Stellar Swirl reaction DMG +36% for 10s;
- Wind of Harvest: restores 5 Elemental Energy, at most once every 4s.
These effects are removed and the order is reset when the equipper leaves the field.
